What is IT asset management and why companies need asset management software?
Ans: Process of tracking, managing, and optimizing an organization’s IT assets throughout their lifecycle. Assets include hardware (computers, servers), software (licenses, subscriptions), and digital resources.

Key Functions:
Inventory Management: Detailed record
Lifecycle Management: From acquisition to disposal
Compliance Tracking: Proper rules to follow
Cost Optimization: Managing expenses effectively
Need:
Improved Asset Visibility
Cost Savings
Compliance Assurance
Risk Mitigation (outdated are danger)
